# Duskwatch Hunter: "This creature can't be blocked by tokens" (CR 509.1b). Bot2's Assembly Specialist brings a Borg token. The
# token may block Bot1's Llanowar Elves, but not the Hunter (refused); the Specialist, a card, may block the Hunter, and does. The
# Hunter (a 4/2 with the counter it put on itself as it entered, the one creature there was to choose) kills the Specialist, and
# the token and the Elves trade. The Elves attack too so that the token has a block to make beside the one it is refused.

